# Copy to `.env` for local runs (do not commit `.env`).
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Quick reference (grouped)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# | Area    | Variable                         | Purpose |
# |---------|----------------------------------|---------|
# | OpenEMR | OPENEMR_BASE_URL                 | Origin: Cookie → session probe; Bearer → /apis/{site}/api/user. |
# | OpenEMR | OPENEMR_SITE_ID                  | Optional multisite id (default default). |
# | OpenEMR | OPENEMR_SESSION_VALIDATE_PATH    | Optional path for cookie validation (default /interface/copilot_session_probe.php). |
# | OpenEMR | OPENEMR_HTTP_TIMEOUT_SECONDS     | Optional; seconds for outbound OpenEMR HTTP (default 30). |
# | Agent   | AGENT_BASE_URL                   | Optional live E2E: deployed FastAPI base URL for POST /agent/chat smoke. |
# | Agent   | AGENT_LLM_CSV_TOOLS           | When `1` + `OPENAI_API_KEY`, chat uses **model-chosen** OpenAI function calls against `fixtures/sample-patients` CSVs (dev/eval). |
# | Agent   | AGENT_DEMO_BYPASS              | Optional; see deploy docs for demo-only flows (never enable in prod). |
# | Chat UI | VITE_AGENT_BASE_URL             | Build/runtime: absolute URL of the agent API for the SPA (see chat-ui/README.md). |
# | Chat UI | VITE_BASE_PATH                  | Vite base path for embedded vs standalone hosting (default `/`). |
# | Chat UI | VITE_EMBEDDED                   | `"true"` when UI is served inside OpenEMR shell (session cookie auth). |
# | Chat UI | VITE_DEV_PROXY_TARGET           | Local dev only: proxy target for `npm run dev` (default http://127.0.0.1:8080). |
# | Live E2E| RUN_LIVE_OPENEMR_E2E            | Set to `1` to enable gated tests (`RUN_LIVE_OPENEMR_TESTS` alias). |
# | Live E2E| OPENEMR_AUTHORIZATION          | Full Authorization header for live tests (e.g. Bearer …). |
# | Live E2E| OPENEMR_BEARER_TOKEN           | Raw token; tests add Bearer if missing. |
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# OpenEMR origin — agent validates Cookie sessions via OPENEMR_SESSION_VALIDATE_PATH
# (default /interface/copilot_session_probe.php on the Fly image); Bearer-only via /apis/default/api/user.
OPENEMR_BASE_URL=https://clinical-copilot-v2.fly.dev

# Optional gated live E2E (`agent/tests/integration/test_live_openemr_optional.py`):
#   RUN_LIVE_OPENEMR_E2E=1
#   OPENEMR_BASE_URL=...   (default above)
# For valid-session assertion only — use ONE of (never commit real values):
#   OPENEMR_AUTHORIZATION=Bearer <token>   # full Authorization header value
#   OPENEMR_BEARER_TOKEN=<token>           # raw token; tests send Bearer prefix if missing
# Optional deployed FastAPI agent smoke (POST /agent/chat via httpx; needs same OpenEMR auth as above):
#   AGENT_BASE_URL=https://...   # trailing slash optional
# Env semantics and skip reasons: see module docstring in agent/tests/integration/test_live_openemr_optional.py
# Alias: RUN_LIVE_OPENEMR_TESTS=1 still enables the same gate.
